---
title: M16 Proposed inspection - conditional success path
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTPS + bridge
    participant P as Project binding
    participant I as InspectTask
    C->>H: Typed alias call
    Note over H: Verify peer<br/>Admit header
    H->>P: Admitted request
    P->>I: Authorize alias<br/>Run Project
    I-->>P: Typed report
    P-->>H: Bridge result
    H-->>C: Validate reply
